# Project core

- `docs/vault` is the canonical source for product intent and architecture.
- Keep the package embeddable: public API is `create_router`, `create_app`, and `mount_static_ui`.
- Preserve host FastAPI conventions instead of forcing a new application shell.
- Prefer clear, typed boundaries and small modules over framework-heavy abstractions.
- Use single quotes where the language and formatter permit it.
- Imports stay at the top of the file — never inside functions, classes, or conditionals.
- Do not implement a feature until its acceptance criteria are traceable to the vault.
- This public repository discloses only the git-analytics domain. Mentions of internal projects, products, infrastructure, or customers are forbidden.
